' Relationships

' Composition
Raytracer *-- BVH : contains
Raytracer *-- Camera : contains
BVH *-- "many" BVHNode : contains

' Aggregation
Raytracer o-- "many" Triangle : references
Raytracer o-- "many" Material : references
Raytracer o-- "many" Texture : references
Raytracer o-- "many" Light : contains
Raytracer o-- "many" ShaderInfo : references

' Association
GUI --> Raytracer : controls
Camera --> ComputeShader : updates
Camera ..> Input : uses
BVH --> Triangle : accelerates

' ShaderInfo owns ComputeShader
ShaderInfo --> ComputeShader : wraps
ShaderInfo *-- "many" ShaderProperty : contains
ShaderProperty --> PropertyType : has type
ShaderProperty ..> HiddenUniformManager : checks visibility
ShaderProperty ..> ReadOnlyUniformManager : checks read-only

' ShaderInfoCollection
ShaderInfoCollection *-- "many" ShaderInfo : manages

' Model to Face/Triangle
Model *-- "many" Face : contains
Face *-- "3" Vertex : contains
Model ..> Triangle : produces

' Friend relationship
GUI ..> Raytracer : <<friend>>

note right of Raytracer
  Main raytracing engine that
  manages the compute shader
  pipeline, scene geometry, 
  and GPU resources.
end note

note right of BVH
  Uses Surface Area Heuristic (SAH)
  for optimal tree construction.
  Uploads nodes and indices to GPU SSBOs.
end note

note right of ShaderInfoCollection
  Singleton that manages all
  compute shaders and their
  properties at runtime.
end note

note bottom of Triangle
  GPU-aligned struct with padding
  for 16-byte SSBO alignment.
end note

@enduml
